reagent-name-go-juice = go-juice
reagent-desc-go-juice = A combat stimulant that temporarily increases movement and melee attack speed. Metabolism also satisfies genetic go-juice dependency.
reagent-effect-guidebook-combat-stimulant = Increases movement speed by { $movement }% and melee attack rate by { $attack }% for { $duration } seconds per unit, up to { $maximum } seconds remaining. Satisfies genetic dependency on this reagent in proportion to the metabolized dose.
ent-GoJuiceChemistryBottle = go-juice bottle
    .desc = A combat stimulant containing 30 units of go-juice. Without an existing withdrawal deficit, this satisfies genetic dependency for 30 minutes.
ent-GeneticInjectorGoJuiceDependency = go-juice dependency genetic injector
    .desc = An administrative injector that activates the go-juice dependency gene.
genetics-gene-go-juice-dependency = Go-juice dependency
genetics-gene-go-juice-dependency-desc = Grants 60 genetic stability but requires regular go-juice. Each metabolized unit replenishes one minute of reserve, up to 30 minutes. Deficiency causes weakness, slower attacks and, after 5 minutes, toxin damage. The accumulated deficit must also be repaid with the drug.
genetics-feeling-go-juice-dependency = Your body changes: it now needs go-juice.
alerts-go-juice-dependency-name = Go-juice dependency
alerts-go-juice-dependency-desc = The number shows the remaining minutes of reserve. Withdrawal starts at zero. Click to check the reserve or accumulated deficit. One unit restores one minute, up to 30 minutes.
chemical-dependency-reserve = { $reagent }: approximately { $minutes } minutes of reserve remaining.
chemical-dependency-deficit = You need { $reagent }. Clearing the accumulated deficit requires { $units } units; further doses replenish your reserve.
chemical-dependency-withdrawal-mild = You lack the chemical your body needs. Your movements are slowing down.
chemical-dependency-withdrawal-moderate = Withdrawal is getting worse. Moving and fighting are becoming difficult.
chemical-dependency-withdrawal-severe = Severe withdrawal is damaging your body! Take the required chemical urgently.
